    form('gufeng','bibi-gufeng','獙獙（姑逢）','Bibi (Gufeng)','有獸焉其状如狐而有翼其音如鴻鴈其名曰獙獙見則天下大旱','獙獙狐状有翼；正文未定翼类，图中一对羽翼、四犬足、赤褐色坐姿为艺术解释。鸿雁仅比音，不添雁首。','Bibi resembles a fox with wings and sounds like wild geese; its appearance is said to bring great drought.','The feathered wing pair, four canine legs, colors and seated pose are artistic interpretations of unspecified wings.',commentary='音斃',en_commentary='Guo Pu gives bi pronunciation.')
