    form('zhenshan','youyou-zhenshan','峳峳','Youyou','有獸焉其状如馬而羊目四角牛尾其音如獋狗其名曰峳峳見則其國多狡客','峳峳马状羊目四角牛尾；图中四支独立角须可数，角位形制、四马足、体色和站姿为艺术解释。獋狗仅比音，狡客兆为古述。','Youyou resembles a horse with sheep eyes, four horns and an ox tail and sounds like a howling dog; its appearance is said to bring crafty guests.','Four horns are mandatory; horn arrangement, four horse legs, colors and stance are artistic.',commentary='音攸；狡狡猾也',en_commentary='Guo Pu gives you pronunciation and explains jiao as crafty.')
