    add('range2-summary','deity','humanface-antlers-range2','兽身人面载觡神（东次二）','Beast-bodied human-faced antlered gods (second range)','其神状皆獸身人靣載觡','兽身人面载觡据正文，麋鹿属角为觡据郭注；图中四足有蹄躯干、双分枝角、人面细节和配色为艺术解释，不将兽身定为鹿身。','The text gives beast bodies, human faces and antlers; commentary compares deer-kind antlers. The chosen quadruped torso, four hooves, two branched antlers, facial details and colors are artistic.','Its gods all have beast bodies, human faces and antlers.',commentary='麋鹿屬角為觡；音格',en_commentary='Guo Pu explains ge as deer-kind antlers and gives ge pronunciation.')
