    shen=water('qizhong','shen-marsh','深澤（跂踵）','Shen marsh (Qizhong)','有水焉廣員四十里皆涌其名曰深澤','Water forty li across wells up throughout; it is called Shen marsh.','深泽四十里皆涌为古述，郭注汾阴瀵水例跨96—97，不将例水作此泽现代定位。',commentary='今河東汾隂縣有瀵水源在地底濆沸涌出其深無限即；此𩔗也',en_commentary='Guo Pu compares a deeply rising Fenshui source in ancient Fenyin; the example continues across units 96–97 and is not a modern identification of this marsh.')
    turtle=form('qizhong','xigui-qizhong','蠵龜（深澤）','Xigui turtles (Shen marsh)','其中多蠵龜','蠵龟郭注大龟、甲有文彩似瑇瑁而薄；图中卵壳形、四龟足、首尾细节、斑纹色彩为艺术解释，不强定现代海龟种。音注遗知反跨97—98，不移给鮯鮯。','Xigui turtles are abundant in the marsh.','The large turtle and thin patterned shell follow commentary. Four ordinary feet, head/tail details, patch pattern and colors are artistic, without a modern species determination.',commentary='蠵觜蠵大龜也甲有文彩似瑇瑁而薄音；遺知反',en_commentary='Guo Pu describes a large turtle with a thin patterned shell resembling daimao; the pronunciation gloss continues across units 97–98.',water=True);pair(shen,turtle)
    gege=form('qizhong','gege-qizhong','鮯鮯之魚','Gege fish','有魚焉其状如鯉而六足鳥尾名曰鮯鮯之魚其鳴自叫','鮯鮯鲤状六足鸟尾、鸣自叫。六足逐数，鸟尾非鱼叉尾；三对足位、趾形、鳞纹、鸟尾羽片形制与配色为艺术解释，不添鸟首鸟翼。','Gege fish resemble carp with six feet and bird tails and call their name.','Six independent feet and one bird tail are mandatory. Three-pair placement, toes, scale/feather details and colors are artistic; no bird head or wings are added.',commentary='音蛤',en_commentary='Guo Pu supplies ge pronunciation.',water=True);pair(shen,gege)
